B.agV=s(["You made it ashore. I am Sela.","Open your stats and put your points into Strength.","Tap me when it is done."],t.s)
B.abm=s(["Stronger already.","That small slime by the fire is watching you.","Tap it, then punch. It is yours alone."],t.s)
